   "name": "Jazz Pharmaceuticals "
  },
  "created_at": "2026-06-13T13:03:11.013704Z",
  "updated_at": "2026-06-16T13:03:38.022557Z",
  "ticker": "JAZZ",
  "drug_name": "Zepzelca (lurbinectedin)",
  "drug_indication": "Relapsed Small Cell Lung Cancer",
  "airtable_id": 8157,
  "stage": "Phase 3",
  "catalyst_date": "2026-06-12",
  "catalyst_source": "https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/jazz-pharmaceuticals-provides-update-on-zepzelca-lurbinectedin-phase-3-lagoon-trial-in-second-line-small-cell-lung-cancer-302798651.html",
  "catalyst_text": "Announced negative Phase 3 topline results in SCLC",
  "detailed_catalyst_text": "Top-line results from the Phase 3 LAGOON trial in second-line metastatic small cell lung cancer showed the study failed to meet the primary overall survival endpoint for both monotherapy and the irinotecan combination versus control. No new safety signals were observed and safety was consistent with known profiles. The results were shared with the FDA in the context of post-marketing requirements for the second-line indication.",
  "catalyst_text_evidence": "DUBLIN, 2026-06-12 /PRNewswire/ -- Jazz Pharmaceuticals plc (NASDAQ:JAZZ) today announced top-line results from the Phase 3 LAGOON trial, conducted by PharmaMar, evaluating Zepzelca (lurbinectedin) in patients with relapsed (second-line) metastatic small cell lung cancer (SCLC). The trial did not meet its primary endpoint of overall survival (OS) evaluating Zepzelca as monotherapy or in combination with irinotecan compared to investigators' choice of topotecan or irinotecan. No new safety signals were identified with Zepzelca monotherapy or in combination with irinotecan, and the overall safety profiles of the investigational arms were consistent with the known safety profile of each agent. The company has shared the LAGOON results with the FDA and will discuss next steps with the agency regarding its post-marketing requirements for the Zepzelca second-line indication.",
  "news_published_at": "2026-06-13T00:00:00Z",
  "open_price_gap_percent": "-0.00309",
  "intra_day_price_change_percent": "-0.02073"
 },
